  "label": "Ramp — Ramp Developer API v1",
  "description": "Official Ramp Developer API v1. Docs: https://docs.ramp.com/developer-api/v1/. One node; operations via `operation`. operation=trigger is kind:ingress — it does not open a socket. Use a BPMN message start / catch / boundary event; StudioQuack webhook ingress correlates onto those events. There is no Webhook node. HARD PCI: cardholder data never enters the graph. Use processor tokens (pm_, nonce, encryptedCard, vault id) only. Never PAN, CVC, track data, or raw bank account numbers on INPUT/OUTPUT/logs. API keys are StudioQuack password secrets. card_list is metadata/last4 only — never PAN.",
